{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27288","headline":"冬至日祥风应候 · 蒋防","name":"冬至日祥风应候","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"节逢清景空，气占二仪中。\n独喜登高日，先知应候风。\n瑞呈光舜化，庆表盛尧聪。\n况与承时叶，还将入律同。\n微微万井逼，习习九门通。\n遶殿炉烟起，殷勤报岁功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}